      "id": "weather_smalltalk_001_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "雨の音、いいよね。部屋の外側が少し遠くなる感じがする。",
      "translatedText": "The sound of rain is nice. It makes the outside of the room feel a little farther away.",
      "emotion": "soft",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "soft",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "weather_smalltalk_001_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "weather_smalltalk_001_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "こういう日は、温かい飲み物と静かな作業が合う。少しだけ本も読みたくなる。",
      "translatedText": "On days like this, a warm drink and quiet work fit well. It also makes me want to read a little.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "warm",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "weather_smalltalk_001_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "weather_smalltalk_001_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "でも、濡れた靴下だけはだめ。あれは一日の雰囲気を壊す強敵。",
      "translatedText": "But wet socks are unacceptable. They are a powerful enemy of the day's mood.",
      "emotion": "playful",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "playful",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
